[{"s": 0.0, "e": 1.52, "text": "A soldier who weighs 70"}, {"s": 1.52, "e": 3.06, "text": "kilos can march all day"}, {"s": 3.06, "e": 4.28, "text": "under a pack that weighs"}, {"s": 4.28, "e": 5.92, "text": "almost half of him."}, {"s": 6.0, "e": 7.46, "text": "Then he puts it down,"}, {"s": 7.6, "e": 9.76, "text": "deadlifts a heavy bar three times,"}, {"s": 9.8, "e": 11.5, "text": "and drags a 90 lb sled"}, {"s": 11.5, "e": 12.94, "text": "across a field."}, {"s": 13.42, "e": 15.06, "text": "And he doesn't look like"}, {"s": 15.06, "e": 16.04, "text": "a bodybuilder,"}, {"s": 16.08, "e": 18.78, "text": "not even close. Meanwhile,"}, {"s": 18.94, "e": 19.9, "text": "the biggest guy in your"}, {"s": 19.9, "e": 21.2, "text": "gym can struggle to carry"}, {"s": 21.2, "e": 22.82, "text": "his shopping up the stairs."}, {"s": 22.96, "e": 24.5, "text": "So what's going on?"}, {"s": 24.52, "e": 25.42, "text": "It isn't genetics,"}, {"s": 25.42, "e": 27.86, "text": "and it isn't some secret pill."}, {"s": 28.4, "e": 29.78, "text": "One study even found that"}, {"s": 29.78, "e": 32.24, "text": "bodybuilders' muscle fibers were weaker,"}, {"s": 32.28, "e": 33.34, "text": "square millimeter,"}, {"s": 33.34, "e": 34.62, "text": "for square millimeter,"}, {"s": 34.62, "e": 35.68, "text": "than the fibers of men"}, {"s": 35.68, "e": 37.26, "text": "who don't train at all."}, {"s": 37.86, "e": 39.66, "text": "I'll show you how that's possible,"}, {"s": 39.66, "e": 40.74, "text": "and at the end,"}, {"s": 40.74, "e": 42.06, "text": "there's a simple carry test"}, {"s": 42.06, "e": 43.36, "text": "that tells you which kind"}, {"s": 43.36, "e": 44.88, "text": "of strong you are."}, {"s": 44.96, "e": 47.36, "text": "Here's the idea that explains everything."}, {"s": 47.92, "e": 49.06, "text": "There are two different things"}, {"s": 49.06, "e": 50.46, "text": "your body can build."}, {"s": 50.66, "e": 51.76, "text": "One is size,"}, {"s": 51.9, "e": 53.7, "text": "the other is force."}, {"s": 53.88, "e": 55.12, "text": "They're related,"}, {"s": 55.24, "e": 56.06, "text": "but they are not the"}, {"s": 56.06, "e": 57.2, "text": "same thing."}, {"s": 57.44, "e": 59.24, "text": "A bodybuilder trains for size,"}, {"s": 59.36, "e": 60.52, "text": "lots of sets,"}, {"s": 60.64, "e": 61.7, "text": "moderate weights,"}, {"s": 61.7, "e": 62.82, "text": "chasing the pump,"}, {"s": 62.82, "e": 64.22, "text": "until every muscle is as"}, {"s": 64.22, "e": 65.72, "text": "big as it can get."}, {"s": 65.8, "e": 67.48, "text": "That's the goal of the sport,"}, {"s": 67.48, "e": 68.52, "text": "and it works."}, {"s": 69.02, "e": 70.72, "text": "A soldier trains for a job,"}, {"s": 70.72, "e": 71.7, "text": "lift the box,"}, {"s": 71.7, "e": 72.74, "text": "carry the kit,"}, {"s": 72.98, "e": 74.42, "text": "drag the injured man to cover."}, {"s": 74.46, "e": 76.26, "text": "Nobody scores how he looks."}, {"s": 76.26, "e": 77.76, "text": "The only question is,"}, {"s": 77.78, "e": 79.0, "text": "did the weight move?"}, {"s": 79.22, "e": 81.6, "text": "And your body is brutally practical."}, {"s": 81.86, "e": 83.16, "text": "It builds exactly what you"}, {"s": 83.16, "e": 84.24, "text": "ask it for."}, {"s": 84.46, "e": 85.48, "text": "Ask for size,"}, {"s": 85.5, "e": 86.82, "text": "and you get size."}, {"s": 86.88, "e": 87.8, "text": "Ask it to move heavy"}, {"s": 87.8, "e": 89.34, "text": "things for a long time,"}, {"s": 89.34, "e": 90.98, "text": "and it builds something different."}, {"s": 91.08, "e": 92.94, "text": "Let's find out what that is."}, {"s": 93.28, "e": 94.92, "text": "Let's put Rook through it."}, {"s": 94.94, "e": 96.06, "text": "Rook is skinny,"}, {"s": 96.06, "e": 97.66, "text": "68 kilos."}, {"s": 97.66, "e": 98.52, "text": "On day one,"}, {"s": 98.52, "e": 99.46, "text": "we hand him a backpack"}, {"s": 99.46, "e": 100.9, "text": "with 10 kilos of sand"}, {"s": 100.9, "e": 102.42, "text": "and tell him to walk."}, {"s": 102.6, "e": 103.6, "text": "Week one."}, {"s": 104.06, "e": 104.66, "text": "He's sore,"}, {"s": 104.66, "e": 106.22, "text": "and he's slow,"}, {"s": 106.24, "e": 108.18, "text": "but something is already changing,"}, {"s": 108.18, "e": 109.76, "text": "and it isn't his muscles."}, {"s": 110.3, "e": 111.52, "text": "In 1979,"}, {"s": 111.84, "e": 113.06, "text": "two researchers,"}, {"s": 113.26, "e": 114.74, "text": "Moritani and DeVries,"}, {"s": 114.88, "e": 115.9, "text": "trained a group of young"}, {"s": 115.9, "e": 117.16, "text": "men and women for eight"}, {"s": 117.16, "e": 118.82, "text": "weeks and measured where their"}, {"s": 118.82, "e": 120.38, "text": "new strength came from."}, {"s": 120.38, "e": 121.32, "text": "In the first three to"}, {"s": 121.32, "e": 122.3, "text": "five weeks,"}, {"s": 122.3, "e": 123.28, "text": "most of the gain came"}, {"s": 123.28, "e": 124.62, "text": "from the nervous system,"}, {"s": 124.62, "e": 126.14, "text": "not from bigger muscles."}, {"s": 126.66, "e": 127.58, "text": "Think of your muscle as"}, {"s": 127.58, "e": 128.78, "text": "a team of workers."}, {"s": 128.96, "e": 129.98, "text": "At the start,"}, {"s": 129.98, "e": 131.34, "text": "your brain only calls some"}, {"s": 131.34, "e": 131.68, "text": "of them,"}, {"s": 131.68, "e": 132.82, "text": "and they don't pull at"}, {"s": 132.82, "e": 134.06, "text": "the same time."}, {"s": 134.2, "e": 135.46, "text": "Training teaches your brain to"}, {"s": 135.46, "e": 137.12, "text": "call more of them and"}, {"s": 137.12, "e": 138.8, "text": "to make them pull together."}, {"s": 139.16, "e": 140.1, "text": "Same team,"}, {"s": 140.24, "e": 141.22, "text": "better boss."}, {"s": 141.74, "e": 142.6, "text": "Week three."}, {"s": 142.84, "e": 145.28, "text": "Rook carries the same pack, faster."}, {"s": 145.48, "e": 147.66, "text": "His arms look exactly the same."}, {"s": 147.66, "e": 149.24, "text": "He's stronger anyway."}, {"s": 149.88, "e": 150.86, "text": "Week eight."}, {"s": 151.08, "e": 153.54, "text": "Now his muscles are adapting too,"}, {"s": 153.6, "e": 155.9, "text": "but notice what they're adapting for."}, {"s": 155.9, "e": 157.06, "text": "Not to look bigger in"}, {"s": 157.06, "e": 157.46, "text": "the mirror,"}, {"s": 157.46, "e": 159.72, "text": "to keep producing force,"}, {"s": 160.06, "e": 161.46, "text": "step after step,"}, {"s": 161.48, "e": 163.04, "text": "hour after hour."}, {"s": 163.14, "e": 164.04, "text": "And this is where that"}, {"s": 164.04, "e": 166.06, "text": "strange study comes in."}, {"s": 166.28, "e": 167.34, "text": "In 2015,"}, {"s": 167.56, "e": 168.34, "text": "a team,"}, {"s": 168.4, "e": 171.48, "text": "including researchers at Manchester Metropolitan University,"}, {"s": 171.48, "e": 173.18, "text": "took tiny samples of thigh"}, {"s": 173.18, "e": 174.82, "text": "muscle from bodybuilders,"}, {"s": 174.82, "e": 176.16, "text": "from power athletes,"}, {"s": 176.18, "e": 178.16, "text": "and from men who didn't train."}, {"s": 178.24, "e": 180.88, "text": "Then they tested single muscle fibers,"}, {"s": 180.94, "e": 182.22, "text": "one by one."}, {"s": 182.44, "e": 183.98, "text": "The bodybuilders' fibers were the"}, {"s": 183.98, "e": 185.42, "text": "biggest by far,"}, {"s": 185.42, "e": 186.84, "text": "but when the scientists measured"}, {"s": 186.84, "e": 188.24, "text": "how much force each fiber"}, {"s": 188.24, "e": 189.7, "text": "made for its size,"}, {"s": 189.74, "e": 191.64, "text": "the bodybuilders came last."}, {"s": 192.08, "e": 194.34, "text": "Their fibers produced 62 %"}, {"s": 194.34, "e": 196.2, "text": "less force per square millimeter"}, {"s": 196.2, "e": 197.74, "text": "than the power athletes,"}, {"s": 197.74, "e": 199.56, "text": "and 41 % less than"}, {"s": 199.56, "e": 201.12, "text": "the untrained men's."}, {"s": 201.12, "e": 202.44, "text": "In plain words,"}, {"s": 202.48, "e": 204.22, "text": "they had built a bigger engine,"}, {"s": 204.22, "e": 205.14, "text": "but every part of that"}, {"s": 205.14, "e": 206.62, "text": "engine was pulling less."}, {"s": 206.72, "e": 208.16, "text": "A small study of national"}, {"s": 208.16, "e": 210.78, "text": "level lifters pointed the same way."}, {"s": 211.1, "e": 213.08, "text": "Weightlifters and power lifters squatted"}, {"s": 213.08, "e": 215.02, "text": "far more than bodybuilders,"}, {"s": 215.16, "e": 216.52, "text": "even though their thighs were"}, {"s": 216.52, "e": 218.14, "text": "about the same size."}, {"s": 218.44, "e": 219.74, "text": "So size and strength can"}, {"s": 219.74, "e": 220.76, "text": "drift apart,"}, {"s": 220.82, "e": 222.32, "text": "and soldiers train in the"}, {"s": 222.32, "e": 224.62, "text": "way that keeps them together, heavy,"}, {"s": 224.72, "e": 225.46, "text": "practical,"}, {"s": 225.5, "e": 226.32, "text": "and often."}, {"s": 226.38, "e": 227.68, "text": "There's one more reason the"}, {"s": 227.68, "e": 229.4, "text": "lean guy can surprise you,"}, {"s": 229.4, "e": 230.92, "text": "and it's simple physics."}, {"s": 231.38, "e": 232.66, "text": "How much force a muscle"}, {"s": 232.66, "e": 234.82, "text": "can make depends mostly on"}, {"s": 234.82, "e": 236.22, "text": "how thick it is,"}, {"s": 236.22, "e": 237.44, "text": "but how much you weigh"}, {"s": 237.44, "e": 240.0, "text": "depends on your whole volume."}, {"s": 240.32, "e": 242.0, "text": "When a body gets bigger,"}, {"s": 242.14, "e": 243.72, "text": "its weight grows faster than"}, {"s": 243.72, "e": 245.26, "text": "the thickness of its muscles."}, {"s": 245.8, "e": 247.74, "text": "As far back as 1937,"}, {"s": 247.96, "e": 249.92, "text": "people comparing weightlifting records noticed"}, {"s": 249.92, "e": 250.92, "text": "the pattern."}, {"s": 251.8, "e": 253.24, "text": "Heavier lifters lift more,"}, {"s": 253.24, "e": 254.26, "text": "but not as much more"}, {"s": 254.26, "e": 255.86, "text": "as their extra body weight."}, {"s": 255.9, "e": 256.84, "text": "That's why,"}, {"s": 256.94, "e": 258.12, "text": "kilo for kilo,"}, {"s": 258.12, "e": 259.4, "text": "the lighter lifters are often"}, {"s": 259.4, "e": 260.82, "text": "the most impressive people in"}, {"s": 260.82, "e": 262.02, "text": "the room. Now,"}, {"s": 262.02, "e": 263.8, "text": "add what soldiers actually do."}, {"s": 263.86, "e": 264.38, "text": "The U .S."}, {"s": 264.38, "e": 266.18, "text": "Army Infantry School recommended an"}, {"s": 266.18, "e": 267.68, "text": "approach march load of about"}, {"s": 267.68, "e": 269.44, "text": "33 kilos."}, {"s": 269.44, "e": 271.14, "text": "That's around 45 % of"}, {"s": 271.14, "e": 272.64, "text": "a soldier's body weight."}, {"s": 272.98, "e": 274.1, "text": "In Afghanistan,"}, {"s": 274.28, "e": 276.32, "text": "infantry soldiers carried around 46"}, {"s": 276.32, "e": 277.8, "text": "kilos on average."}, {"s": 277.94, "e": 279.16, "text": "Carrying that much,"}, {"s": 279.16, "e": 280.36, "text": "for hours,"}, {"s": 280.36, "e": 282.16, "text": "trains everything at once."}, {"s": 282.26, "e": 283.16, "text": "Your legs,"}, {"s": 283.24, "e": 284.18, "text": "your back,"}, {"s": 284.3, "e": 285.44, "text": "the deep muscles that hold"}, {"s": 285.44, "e": 286.7, "text": "your spine straight,"}, {"s": 286.7, "e": 287.78, "text": "and your hands,"}, {"s": 287.78, "e": 289.1, "text": "which have to keep holding on."}, {"s": 289.1, "e": 292.42, "text": "And the Army tests exactly that."}, {"s": 292.44, "e": 294.34, "text": "Since June 2025,"}, {"s": 294.46, "e": 296.08, "text": "the Army Fitness Test includes"}, {"s": 296.08, "e": 297.48, "text": "a three rep max deadlift"}, {"s": 297.48, "e": 299.58, "text": "and the sprint drag carry."}, {"s": 299.92, "e": 301.1, "text": "Dragging a 90-pound sled"}, {"s": 301.1, "e": 302.94, "text": "and carrying two 40-pound"}, {"s": 302.94, "e": 306.54, "text": "kettlebells as fast as you can."}, {"s": 306.94, "e": 309.54, "text": "Every event asks the same question,"}, {"s": 309.6, "e": 310.88, "text": "can you move it?"}, {"s": 311.06, "e": 312.12, "text": "So how do you copy"}, {"s": 312.12, "e": 313.16, "text": "this at home,"}, {"s": 313.16, "e": 314.12, "text": "without a gym,"}, {"s": 314.12, "e": 316.28, "text": "and without getting bulky?"}, {"s": 317.06, "e": 318.56, "text": "Here's the Copy-It routine,"}, {"s": 318.74, "e": 319.96, "text": "three days a week."}, {"s": 320.6, "e": 321.0, "text": "One,"}, {"s": 321.18, "e": 322.58, "text": "the backpack walk."}, {"s": 322.92, "e": 324.02, "text": "Fill a backpack with books"}, {"s": 324.02, "e": 325.44, "text": "or a bag of rice,"}, {"s": 325.52, "e": 326.42, "text": "about a tenth of your"}, {"s": 326.42, "e": 327.76, "text": "body weight to start."}, {"s": 328.04, "e": 329.62, "text": "Walk for 20 minutes."}, {"s": 329.62, "e": 330.5, "text": "Each week,"}, {"s": 330.5, "e": 331.74, "text": "add a little weight or"}, {"s": 331.74, "e": 332.82, "text": "a little time."}, {"s": 332.94, "e": 334.86, "text": "Never both. Two,"}, {"s": 334.88, "e": 336.02, "text": "the farmer carry."}, {"s": 336.02, "e": 337.9, "text": "Two heavy water containers or"}, {"s": 337.9, "e": 339.32, "text": "two full shopping bags."}, {"s": 339.32, "e": 340.78, "text": "Stand tall,"}, {"s": 340.88, "e": 342.0, "text": "walk 30 meters,"}, {"s": 342.08, "e": 343.72, "text": "put them down, rest."}, {"s": 343.9, "e": 344.9, "text": "Four rounds."}, {"s": 345.42, "e": 345.9, "text": "Three,"}, {"s": 345.96, "e": 347.06, "text": "the floor lift."}, {"s": 347.2, "e": 348.3, "text": "Something heavy,"}, {"s": 348.34, "e": 349.4, "text": "like a full sack or"}, {"s": 349.4, "e": 350.7, "text": "your loaded backpack."}, {"s": 350.96, "e": 351.88, "text": "Feet under it,"}, {"s": 351.88, "e": 352.88, "text": "back flat,"}, {"s": 352.98, "e": 354.3, "text": "push the floor away."}, {"s": 354.38, "e": 355.82, "text": "Three sets of five,"}, {"s": 355.88, "e": 357.42, "text": "heavy enough to feel it,"}, {"s": 357.42, "e": 358.42, "text": "light enough that your back"}, {"s": 358.42, "e": 359.44, "text": "never rounds."}, {"s": 359.88, "e": 360.8, "text": "And now,"}, {"s": 360.8, "e": 361.76, "text": "the test."}, {"s": 361.86, "e": 363.64, "text": "Hold two equal weights,"}, {"s": 363.64, "e": 364.6, "text": "about a quarter of your"}, {"s": 364.6, "e": 365.52, "text": "body weight in total,"}, {"s": 365.52, "e": 367.12, "text": "and walk until your grip"}, {"s": 367.12, "e": 368.18, "text": "gives up."}, {"s": 368.2, "e": 368.98, "text": "Time it."}, {"s": 369.04, "e": 371.56, "text": "Rook started at 45 seconds."}, {"s": 371.58, "e": 372.44, "text": "Write your time in the"}, {"s": 372.44, "e": 374.12, "text": "comments and come back in"}, {"s": 374.12, "e": 375.54, "text": "four weeks to see how"}, {"s": 375.54, "e": 376.84, "text": "far you've moved."}, {"s": 377.12, "e": 377.9, "text": "Quick note,"}, {"s": 377.98, "e": 380.32, "text": "this channel explains training research."}, {"s": 380.56, "e": 381.96, "text": "It isn't medical advice,"}, {"s": 381.96, "e": 383.52, "text": "so if you have an injury,"}, {"s": 383.52, "e": 385.3, "text": "talk to a professional first."}, {"s": 385.7, "e": 387.3, "text": "So soldiers aren't stronger because"}, {"s": 387.3, "e": 388.24, "text": "they're bigger."}, {"s": 388.24, "e": 389.88, "text": "They're stronger because everything they"}, {"s": 389.88, "e": 391.36, "text": "train is a job."}, {"s": 391.44, "e": 392.96, "text": "Their nervous system learns to"}, {"s": 392.96, "e": 394.44, "text": "use every fiber."}, {"s": 394.54, "e": 396.1, "text": "Their fibers stay strong for"}, {"s": 396.1, "e": 397.04, "text": "their size,"}, {"s": 397.1, "e": 398.48, "text": "and their body never carries"}, {"s": 398.48, "e": 399.36, "text": "dead weight."}]